    "方向を決め、今日のタスクに落とし込み、Flowで実際の集中時間を記録します。履歴と統計で振り返ったら、次に時間を向ける先を選びます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a Direction, turn it into today's Tasks, and record the focused time you actually spend in Flow. Review your History and Statistics, then decide where to direct your time next."
